[
  {
    "screen": 1,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "老张站在人家门口，",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 2,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "手都是抖的。",
    "chars": 6
  },
  {
    "screen": 3,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "满楼就老李会修水管，",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 4,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "偏偏这位老李，",
    "chars": 7
  },
  {
    "screen": 5,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "半年前让老张得罪透了。",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 6,
    "line_id": "A03",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "就说楼下的老张吧：",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 7,
    "line_id": "A03",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "为个停车位，跟老李吵翻了，",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 8,
    "line_id": "A03",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "话说得绝，老死不相往来。",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 9,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "《名言佳句》这本书里，",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 10,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "收了一句俄罗斯老话，",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 11,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "归在克雷洛夫名下：",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 12,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "不要把痰吐在井里，",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 13,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "哪天你口渴的时候，",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 14,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "也要上井边来喝水。",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 15,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "这话提醒的就是——",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 16,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "别只顾一时痛快。",
    "chars": 8
  },
  {
    "screen": 17,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "这不，半年后老张家水管爆了，",
    "chars": 14
  },
  {
    "screen": 18,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "水漫到楼下。",
    "chars": 6
  },
  {
    "screen": 19,
    "line_id": "A07",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "您说这门，敲还是不敲？",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 20,
    "line_id": "A08",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "敲吧，话说绝了，没那个脸；",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 21,
    "line_id": "A08",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "不敲吧，家里还淌着水呢。",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 22,
    "line_id": "A09",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "说到底，",
    "chars": 4
  },
  {
    "screen": 23,
    "line_id": "A09",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "留三分路不是什么大道理，",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 24,
    "line_id": "A09",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "就是给日子留个回旋：",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 25,
    "line_id": "A09",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "今天您给人留的门，",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 26,
    "line_id": "A09",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "明天可能就是自己的路。",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 27,
    "line_id": "A10",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "书就在我主页橱窗里，",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 28,
    "line_id": "A10",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "点开我主页，商品橱窗里就有。",
    "chars": 14
  },
  {
    "screen": 29,
    "line_id": "A11",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "把人得罪光了又回头求人的事，",
    "chars": 14
  },
  {
    "screen": 30,
    "line_id": "A11",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "您见过吗？",
    "chars": 5
  }
]